# Developer-time model tools for MERIT EVENT MAKER — NOT an app dependency.
# Installed into .venv-model-dev/ by tools/model-dev/setup.sh; the product
# (index.html, src/, the offline packages) never loads any of this.
#
# Olive's own wheel is installed separately with --no-deps (see setup.sh):
# its metadata requires torch, and on Linux the only torch PyPI serves is the
# CUDA build (several GB of nvidia-* wheels); the CPU index is not reachable
# from this environment. Its other dependencies are listed here. Measured:
# `import olive` itself still needs torch (and torchmetrics), so Olive is
# importable only after setup.sh --with-olive; ONNX Runtime's own quantizer is
# the torch-free path (examples/quantize_detector.py --engine ort).
